      "step_id": 0,
      "title": "Follow protocol steps for MRI preparation",
      "instruction": "A guideline for the following steps is provided in this protocol: 1) Perfusion, storage, and ex vivo MRI, 2) Brain dissection, 3) Processing of tissue prepared for MRI, 4) Embedding into paraffin blocks, 5) Sectioning, 6) Immunohistochemistry, and 7) Registration of histological images to MRI.",
