      "is_critical": false,
      "timers": []
    },
    {
      "step_id": 1,
      "title": "Prepare mouse brain samples for embedding",
      "instruction": "Before starting the protocol, animals must have been fixed with intracardiac perfusion, brains collected and imaged with MRI. This guideline is optimized for adult mouse brain tissue that was stored for an extended time for ex vivo MRI and describes how to embed both single and multiple mouse brain samples within a single block and how to get optimized histological slides that can then be registered to MRI.",
      "substeps": [
        {
          "instruction": "Fix animals with intracardiac perfusion",
